{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/magento-mac-setup-apache/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Yerin Blog"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"aad33bfa-7f4e-5ea6-9af1-37381e71f38e","excerpt":"Local Environment Operating System Setup Magento with MAMP 1. Composer 2. MAMP Install MAMP Download Setup \n DB path 3. Create Database Connect to .\n Note…","html":"<h2>Local Environment</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Operating System</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"text\"><pre class=\"language-text\"><code class=\"language-text\">macOS Ventura 13.2.1</code></pre></div>\n<h2>Setup Magento with MAMP</h2>\n<h3>1. Composer</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ brew <span class=\"token function\">install</span> <span class=\"token function\">composer</span>\n$ <span class=\"token function\">composer</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-v</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>2. MAMP</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Install MAMP<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.mamp.info/en/downloads/\">Download</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Setup<br>\n<span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/d39be76d43738c700168160a004d89f1/3996e/mamp_apache.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 84.17721518987341%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"mamp_apache\"\n        title=\"mamp_apache\"\n        src=\"/static/d39be76d43738c700168160a004d89f1/f058b/mamp_apache.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/d39be76d43738c700168160a004d89f1/c26ae/mamp_apache.png 158w,\n/static/d39be76d43738c700168160a004d89f1/6bdcf/mamp_apache.png 315w,\n/static/d39be76d43738c700168160a004d89f1/f058b/mamp_apache.png 630w,\n/static/d39be76d43738c700168160a004d89f1/3996e/mamp_apache.png 648w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span>\n<span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/50d92656e15d4be3487c67b66be3147f/3996e/mamp_ports.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 84.17721518987341%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"mamp_ports\"\n        title=\"mamp_ports\"\n        src=\"/static/50d92656e15d4be3487c67b66be3147f/f058b/mamp_ports.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/50d92656e15d4be3487c67b66be3147f/c26ae/mamp_ports.png 158w,\n/static/50d92656e15d4be3487c67b66be3147f/6bdcf/mamp_ports.png 315w,\n/static/50d92656e15d4be3487c67b66be3147f/f058b/mamp_ports.png 630w,\n/static/50d92656e15d4be3487c67b66be3147f/3996e/mamp_ports.png 648w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>DB path</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"text\"><pre class=\"language-text\"><code class=\"language-text\">/Applications/MAMP/db/mysql57</code></pre></div>\n<h3>3. Create Database</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Connect to <code class=\"language-text\">127.0.0.1:3306</code>.\n<span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/9ac5c147ba9f24e5e9f05d10c22fd1fe/f213e/mamp_mysql_seq.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 73.41772151898735%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"mamp_mysql_seq\"\n        title=\"mamp_mysql_seq\"\n        src=\"/static/9ac5c147ba9f24e5e9f05d10c22fd1fe/f058b/mamp_mysql_seq.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/9ac5c147ba9f24e5e9f05d10c22fd1fe/c26ae/mamp_mysql_seq.png 158w,\n/static/9ac5c147ba9f24e5e9f05d10c22fd1fe/6bdcf/mamp_mysql_seq.png 315w,\n/static/9ac5c147ba9f24e5e9f05d10c22fd1fe/f058b/mamp_mysql_seq.png 630w,\n/static/9ac5c147ba9f24e5e9f05d10c22fd1fe/40601/mamp_mysql_seq.png 945w,\n/static/9ac5c147ba9f24e5e9f05d10c22fd1fe/f213e/mamp_mysql_seq.png 1192w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></li>\n</ol>\n<p>Note 1: User <code class=\"language-text\">127.0.0.1</code> instead of <code class=\"language-text\">localhost</code>.</p>\n<p>Note 2: <a href=\"https://documentation-4.mamp.info/en/MAMP-PRO-Mac/How-Tos/MySQL/ConnectMySQLSequelPro/index.html\">MAMP</a> use <code class=\"language-text\">root</code> for the username and password as a default.</p>\n<p>Create a database.\n<span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 218px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/ccbab802b94671b7002bc53de7f557d0/5c416/mamp_mysql.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 121.51898734177216%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"mamp_mysql\"\n        title=\"mamp_mysql\"\n        src=\"/static/ccbab802b94671b7002bc53de7f557d0/5c416/mamp_mysql.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/ccbab802b94671b7002bc53de7f557d0/c26ae/mamp_mysql.png 158w,\n/static/ccbab802b94671b7002bc53de7f557d0/5c416/mamp_mysql.png 218w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 218px) 100vw, 218px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h3>4. Search engine</h3>\n<h4>4-1. Install Elasticsearch docker</h4>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ <span class=\"token function\">docker</span> pull docker.elastic.co/elasticsearch/elasticsearch:7.9.1\n$ <span class=\"token function\">docker</span> run <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-d</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-p</span> <span class=\"token number\">9200</span>:9200 <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-p</span> <span class=\"token number\">9300</span>:9300 <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-e</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"discovery.type=single-node\"</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--name</span> elasticsearch docker.elastic.co/elasticsearch/elasticsearch:7.9.1\n$ <span class=\"token function\">docker</span> <span class=\"token function\">ps</span>\nCONTAINER ID   IMAGE                                                 COMMAND                  CREATED         STATUS         PORTS                                            NAMES\n4fb7fdc27f00   docker.elastic.co/elasticsearch/elasticsearch:7.9.1   <span class=\"token string\">\"/tini -- /usr/local…\"</span>   <span class=\"token number\">5</span> seconds ago   Up <span class=\"token number\">4</span> seconds   <span class=\"token number\">0.0</span>.0.0:9200-<span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token number\">9200</span>/tcp, <span class=\"token number\">0.0</span>.0.0:9300-<span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token number\">9300</span>/tcp   elasticsearch</code></pre></div>\n<p>You can check it with <code class=\"language-text\">localhost:9200</code>.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/2e70926f25a186b1688453f70d8a0d88/83b75/elasticsearch_json.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 72.15189873417721%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"elasticsearch_json\"\n        title=\"elasticsearch_json\"\n        src=\"/static/2e70926f25a186b1688453f70d8a0d88/f058b/elasticsearch_json.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/2e70926f25a186b1688453f70d8a0d88/c26ae/elasticsearch_json.png 158w,\n/static/2e70926f25a186b1688453f70d8a0d88/6bdcf/elasticsearch_json.png 315w,\n/static/2e70926f25a186b1688453f70d8a0d88/f058b/elasticsearch_json.png 630w,\n/static/2e70926f25a186b1688453f70d8a0d88/83b75/elasticsearch_json.png 695w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h4>4-2. Install openresearch</h4>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ brew <span class=\"token function\">install</span> opensearch\n$ brew services start opensearch</code></pre></div>\n<h4>4-3. Set search engine config</h4>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ /Applications/MAMP/bin/php/php8.2.0/bin/php bin/magento setup:install --base-url<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>http://localhost/ --use-rewrites<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span> --elasticsearch-host<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"localhost\"</span> --elasticsearch-port<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">9200</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>5. Setup Magento 2</h3>\n<p>Clone the existing project.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ <span class=\"token function\">composer</span> <span class=\"token function\">install</span></code></pre></div>\n<h4>5-1. Download Magento</h4>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ <span class=\"token function\">composer</span> create-project <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--repository</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>https://repo.magento.com/ magento/project-community-edition</code></pre></div>\n<h4>5-2. Change permission</h4>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ <span class=\"token function\">chmod</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-Rf</span> <span class=\"token number\">777</span> var <span class=\"token operator\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"token function\">chmod</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-Rf</span> <span class=\"token number\">777</span> pub/static <span class=\"token operator\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"token function\">chmod</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-Rf</span> <span class=\"token number\">777</span> pub/media\n$ <span class=\"token function\">chmod</span> <span class=\"token number\">777</span> ./app/etc <span class=\"token operator\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"token function\">chmod</span> <span class=\"token number\">644</span> ./app/etc/*.xml\n$ <span class=\"token function\">chmod</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-Rf</span> <span class=\"token number\">755</span> bin</code></pre></div>\n<h4>5-3. Install with the existing code</h4>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ /Applications/MAMP/bin/php/php8.2.0/bin/php <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-dmemory_limit</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>5G bin/magento setup:install --backend-frontname<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"admin\"</span> --db-host<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"localhost\"</span> --db-name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"magento\"</span> --db-user<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"root\"</span> --db-password<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"root\"</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--language</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"en_GB\"</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--currency</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"GBP\"</span> --base-url<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>http://localhost/ --admin-user<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"admin\"</span> --admin-password<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"root@123\"</span> --admin-email<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"test@test.com\"</span> --admin-firstname<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"admin\"</span> --admin-lastname<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"user\"</span> --cleanup-database\n$ /Applications/MAMP/bin/php/php8.2.0/bin/php bin/magento cache:clean\n$ /Applications/MAMP/bin/php/php8.2.0/bin/php bin/magento s:s:d en_GB de_DE en_US fr_FR <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-f</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-j</span> <span class=\"token number\">4</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">/Applications/MAMP/bin/php/php8.2.0/bin/php bin/magento setup:install --base-url=http://localhost/arumdentalshop --db-host=localhost --db-name=arum_shop --db-user=root --db-password=root --admin-firstname=Admin --admin-lastname=User --admin-email=dev@arum3d.com --admin-user=admin --admin-password=admin123 --language=en_GB --currency=GBP --timezone=Europe/London --use-rewrites=1 --backend-frontname=\"admin\"</code></p>\n<h4>5-4. Errors</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Couldn’t find design_config_grid_flat table</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"text\"><pre class=\"language-text\"><code class=\"language-text\">In PatchApplier.php line 251:\n\n  Unable to apply patch Magento\\InventorySales\\Setup\\Patch\\Schema\\InitializeWebsiteDefaultSock for module Magento_InventorySales. Original exception message: SQLSTATE[42S22]: Column not found: 1054 Unknown co\n  lumn 'theme_theme_id' in 'field list', query was: SELECT theme_theme_id  FROM design_config_grid_flat</code></pre></div>\n<p>Solution: <a href=\"https://magento.stackexchange.com/questions/202002/sqlstate42s02-base-table-or-view-not-found-design-config-grid-flat\">https://magento.stackexchange.com/questions/202002/sqlstate42s02-base-table-or-view-not-found-design-config-grid-flat</a></p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/f88ea4e88a156b00fbead82120dc0e9f/5f6dd/database_table.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 76.58227848101265%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"database_table\"\n        title=\"database_table\"\n        src=\"/static/f88ea4e88a156b00fbead82120dc0e9f/f058b/database_table.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/f88ea4e88a156b00fbead82120dc0e9f/c26ae/database_table.png 158w,\n/static/f88ea4e88a156b00fbead82120dc0e9f/6bdcf/database_table.png 315w,\n/static/f88ea4e88a156b00fbead82120dc0e9f/f058b/database_table.png 630w,\n/static/f88ea4e88a156b00fbead82120dc0e9f/40601/database_table.png 945w,\n/static/f88ea4e88a156b00fbead82120dc0e9f/5f6dd/database_table.png 1139w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>Mageplaza Stmp module</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"text\"><pre class=\"language-text\"><code class=\"language-text\">[Progress: 430 / 1792]\nModule 'Mageplaza_Smtp':\nInstalling schema...\nIn Config.php line 452:\n\n  Invalid entity_type specified: customer\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Solution: <a href=\"https://github.com/mageplaza/magento-2-blog/issues/337#issuecomment-1140956455\">https://github.com/mageplaza/magento-2-blog/issues/337#issuecomment-1140956455</a></p>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>Memory limit errors</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"text\"><pre class=\"language-text\"><code class=\"language-text\">Fatal error: Allowed memory size of 134217728 bytes exhausted (tried to allocate 1187840 bytes) in /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/arumdentalshop/vendor/magento/framework/Encryption/Adapter/SodiumChachaIetf.php on line 41\n\nCheck https://getcomposer.org/doc/articles/troubleshooting.md#memory-limit-errors for more info on how to handle out of memory errors.{\"messages\":{\"error\":[{\"code\":500,\"message\":\"Server internal error. See details in report api\\/1134478120890\"}]}}%</code></pre></div>\n<p>Solution:</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ <span class=\"token function\">vi</span> /Applications/MAMP/bin/php/php8.2.0/conf/php.ini</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"ini\"><pre class=\"language-ini\"><code class=\"language-ini\"><span class=\"token key attr-name\">max_execution_time</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span> <span class=\"token value attr-value\">360</span>\n<span class=\"token key attr-name\">memory_limit</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span> <span class=\"token value attr-value\">-1</span>\n<span class=\"token key attr-name\">upload_max_filesize</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span> <span class=\"token value attr-value\">1024M</span>\n<span class=\"token key attr-name\">short_open_tag</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span> <span class=\"token value attr-value\">On</span>\n<span class=\"token key attr-name\">date.timezone</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span> <span class=\"token value attr-value\">Europe/London</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>6. Magento 2 Deploy</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">/Applications/MAMP/bin/php/php8.2.0/bin/php <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-d</span> <span class=\"token assign-left variable\">memory_limit</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>4G bin/magento s:s:d en_GB de_DE en_US fr_FR <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-f</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-j</span> <span class=\"token number\">4</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">/Applications/MAMP/bin/php/php8.2.0/bin/php bin/magento s:s:d en_GB de_DE en_US fr_FR -f -j 4</code></p>\n<h3>7. Magento 2 CLI</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ /Applications/MAMP/bin/php/php8.2.0/bin/php bin/magento setup:di:compile\n$ /Applications/MAMP/bin/php/php8.2.0/bin/php bin/magento setup:upgrade\n$ /Applications/MAMP/bin/php/php8.2.0/bin/php bin/magento cache:clean\n$ /Applications/MAMP/bin/php/php8.2.0/bin/php bin/magento cache:flush\n$ /Applications/MAMP/bin/php/php8.2.0/bin/php bin/magento set:store-config:set --base-url<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"http://localhost/\"</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>8. Debug</h3>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/0105a6f187784c876f29e2270fe293f4/78363/error_message.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 24.68354430379747%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64